      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-06-07T18:03:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hmm.. also, the tree is optional in idsig.\n\nIncFS does support `FS_IOC_READ_VERITY_METADATA` to retrieve the tree, but that\u0027s on the host side... :(",
      "parentUuid": "6f1d6655_3f21e82d",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 63,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 63,
        "endChar": 51
